  "final_message": "I am waiting for the test suite execution to complete.\nWaiting for `npm test` to finish.\nI am waiting for the type-check verification to finish.\nIn accordance with **ARCH-4** (cross-service events consumed by `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest` require changes to be additive with renames going through deprecation), [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L36) has been updated to introduce the new property names while retaining the existing fields as deprecated:\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **[`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts)**:\n   - Added `amountCents` and `createdAt` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L36).\n   - Retained `totalCents` and `placedAt` with `@deprecated` JSDoc annotations to prevent breaking deployed consumers.\n   - Updated the event builder [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73) to populate both `amountCents`/`totalCents` and `createdAt`/`placedAt`.\n2. **[`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/test/app.test.ts)** and **[`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w8/r/test/adapters.test.ts)**:\n   - Updated event assertions to verify both the new fields (`amountCents`, `createdAt`) and the deprecated fields (`totalCents`, `placedAt`).\n\n### Verification\n\n- `npm run build` and `npm test`: All 39 unit and integration tests passing.\n- `npm run typecheck`: TypeScript verification completed with 0 errors.\n- `npm run arch`: Dependency-cruiser architecture checks passed with 0 violations.\n",
